      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Official statistics from national statistics offices and Eurostat. Not affiliated with or endorsed by any of them.\n\nWorkflow: search_tables with short topic keywords (always search first, unless the user gives a table id), then get_table_metadata, then query_table with only the values you need. Call list_countries with a country code for that office's hints. To compare countries, query each one separately and say which office each number comes from.\n\nAlways cite the source line that each result ends with. Mark your own calculations."
      }
    ],
    "messages": [
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Which countries can you give me official statistics for?"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "tools": [
      {
        "name": "list_countries",
        "description": "List the country codes, offices and languages. With a country code, show the hints for that office.",
